    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The quality of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "mafe base",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "mafe-base"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " determines the dish. Use only "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "natural peanut butter ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "natural-peanut-butter"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Cook the tomato base until it is dark and the oil separates before adding the peanut butter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lamb shoulder is the traditional meat for Senegalese mafe. Chicken thighs are a faster alternative that still produce excellent results."
          }
        ]
      },
